<title>TAIWAN: TENNIS-TAIWAN BEAT SINGAPORE IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TAIWAN BEAT SINGAPORE IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan completed a 5-0 victory over Singapore in their Davis Cup tennis Asia/Oceania zone group two first-round tie on Sunday when they won both the reverse singles.</p>
<p>Results (Taiwan names first):</p>
<p>Tsai Chia-yen beat Chen Chee Yen 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Lien Yu-hui beat Tan Ee Wei 6-1 6-0</p>
